# 预研头脑风暴索引
- 20260402-1111--sample-receipt

- 20260402-1111--sample-receipt
  - brainstorms: docs/B1-docs/raw-20260402-1111/brainstorms.md
  - candidates: docs/B1-docs/raw-20260402-1111/candidates.md

## 收敛
EOF
