# Milestones

## M-20260402-1111-sample

- status: active

### candidate_issues

### committed_issues

1. `I-20260402-1111-A`
- title: sample owner
- milestone_state: committed
- phase_state: `in_dev`
- priority: P1
- issue_path: `docs/B2-docs/sample/issues/sample.md`
- source_candidates:
  - `docs/B1-docs/raw-20260402-1111/candidates.md#c-20260402-1111-a`
- next_action: implement sample owner

### completed_issues

- none currently
EOF
  cat > "$repo/docs/B2-docs/sample/issues/sample.md" <<'EOF'
# Issue: sample

- issue_id: `I-20260402-1111-A`
- phase_state: `in_dev`
- milestone: `M-20260402-1111-sample`
- source_candidate: `docs/B1-docs/raw-20260402-1111/candidates.md#c-20260402-1111-a`
EOF
