cat > "$REPO_BREAK/docs/system/workspace/hooks/protected-branch-breakglass-receipts.md" <<EOF
# Protected Branch Break-Glass Receipts

- audit_effective_date: \`2026-04-02\`

## Receipt: $BREAK_COMMIT

- target_branch: \`develop\`
- source_branch: \`test-pre-merge-20260402-breakglass\`
